## Refresh policy

NEVER hand-edit files under `relay/vendor/`. A refresh is:

```bash
node scripts/refresh-vendor.mjs
```

which, in order: fetches every `upstream-verbatim` file at the commit above and
asserts its recorded `upstream` hash (aborting before any write on a mismatch),
runs `scripts/patch-vendor-specifiers.mjs`, then regenerates the `patched`
hashes in `src/server/__tests__/vendor-hashes.json`. `upstream` is never derived
from disk — bumping `upstreamCommit` is a deliberate edit of the manifest.
Adaptation beyond the import rewrite happens in `relay-instance.ts` via
subclass/wrapper only.
